{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國新申領失業金人數稍為增加，但仍低過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布，首次申領失業保險救濟人數上星期增加1,000人，至19.9萬，但少過市場預期的20萬人。</p><p></p><p>持續申領人數按周則減少4,000人，至171萬，但輕微多過市場預期的170.9萬人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:50.043978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:45.812574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:16.592821+00:00","content_hash":"c27772b66a571a60da5316ba6873c649446d8d94bfe7433b50a983ea2d0a9768","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}